numerical methods in both Python and Julia. It is intended to be an exercise
then don't expect the code to be good enough for real use. Also,
I should mention that I have almost no experience with Julia, so it
probably won't be idiomatic Julia but more Python-like Julia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;section id="cholesky-decomposition"&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Cholesky decomposition&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today we have &lt;a class="reference external" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cholesky_decomposition"&gt;Cholesky decomposition&lt;/a&gt;.
It is a factorization of a Hermitian, positive-definite matrix into
a lower and upper matrix, the main difference with LU decomposition
is that it the lower matrix is the Hermitian transpose of the upper one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Following are the codes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;section id="python"&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Python&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class="code"&gt;&lt;pre class="code python"&gt;&lt;a id="rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-1" name="rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-1" href="https://nicoguaro.github.io/posts/numerical_challenge/numerical-29/#rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-1"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class="kn"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nn"&gt;__future__&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="kn"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;division&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;print_function&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a id="rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-2" name="rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-2" href="https://nicoguaro.github.io/posts/numerical_challenge/numerical-29/#rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-2"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class="kn"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nn"&gt;numpy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;as&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nn"&gt;np&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a id="rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-3" name="rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-3" href="https://nicoguaro.github.io/posts/numerical_challenge/numerical-29/#rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-3"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a id="rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-4" name="rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-4" href="https://nicoguaro.github.io/posts/numerical_challenge/numerical-29/#rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-4"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a id="rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-5" name="rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-5" href="https://nicoguaro.github.io/posts/numerical_challenge/numerical-29/#rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-5"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;def&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;cholesky&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;mat&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;):&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a id="rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-6" name="rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-6" href="https://nicoguaro.github.io/posts/numerical_challenge/numerical-29/#rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-6"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;    &lt;span class="n"&gt;m&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;_&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;mat&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;shape&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a id="rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-7" name="rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-7" href="https://nicoguaro.github.io/posts/numerical_challenge/numerical-29/#rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-7"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;    &lt;span class="n"&gt;mat&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;mat&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;copy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a id="rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-8" name="rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-8" href="https://nicoguaro.github.io/posts/numerical_challenge/numerical-29/#rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-8"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;    &lt;span class="k"&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;col&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="ow"&gt;in&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nb"&gt;range&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;m&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;):&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a id="rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-9" name="rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-9" href="https://nicoguaro.github.io/posts/numerical_challenge/numerical-29/#rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-9"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;        &lt;span class="nb"&gt;print&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;mat&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;col&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;col&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a id="rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-10" name="rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-10" href="https://nicoguaro.github.io/posts/numerical_challenge/numerical-29/#rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-10"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;               &lt;span class="n"&gt;mat&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;col&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mi"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;col&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;dot&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;mat&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;col&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mi"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;col&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]))&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a id="rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-11" name="rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-11" href="https://nicoguaro.github.io/posts/numerical_challenge/numerical-29/#rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-11"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;        &lt;span class="n"&gt;mat&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;col&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;col&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;np&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;sqrt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;mat&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;col&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;col&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a id="rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-12" name="rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-12" href="https://nicoguaro.github.io/posts/numerical_challenge/numerical-29/#rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-12"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;               &lt;span class="n"&gt;mat&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;col&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mi"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;col&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;dot&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;mat&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;col&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mi"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;col&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]))&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a id="rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-13" name="rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-13" href="https://nicoguaro.github.io/posts/numerical_challenge/numerical-29/#rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-13"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;        &lt;span class="k"&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;row&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="ow"&gt;in&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nb"&gt;range&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;col&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;+&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mi"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;m&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;):&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a id="rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-14" name="rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-14" href="https://nicoguaro.github.io/posts/numerical_challenge/numerical-29/#rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-14"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;            &lt;span class="n"&gt;mat&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;row&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;col&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;mat&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;row&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;col&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a id="rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-15" name="rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-15" href="https://nicoguaro.github.io/posts/numerical_challenge/numerical-29/#rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-15"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;               &lt;span class="n"&gt;mat&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;row&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mi"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;col&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;dot&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;mat&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;col&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mi"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;col&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]))&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;mat&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;col&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;col&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a id="rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-16" name="rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-16" href="https://nicoguaro.github.io/posts/numerical_challenge/numerical-29/#rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-16"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;    &lt;span class="k"&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;row&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="ow"&gt;in&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nb"&gt;range&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;m&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;):&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a id="rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-17" name="rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-17" href="https://nicoguaro.github.io/posts/numerical_challenge/numerical-29/#rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-17"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;        &lt;span class="n"&gt;mat&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;row&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;row&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mi"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a id="rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-18" name="rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-18" href="https://nicoguaro.github.io/posts/numerical_challenge/numerical-29/#rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-18"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;    &lt;span class="k"&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;mat&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a id="rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-19" name="rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-19" href="https://nicoguaro.github.io/posts/numerical_challenge/numerical-29/#rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-19"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a id="rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-20" name="rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-20" href="https://nicoguaro.github.io/posts/numerical_challenge/numerical-29/#rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-20"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a id="rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-21" name="rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-21" href="https://nicoguaro.github.io/posts/numerical_challenge/numerical-29/#rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-21"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;A&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;np&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;array&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;([&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a id="rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-22" name="rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-22" href="https://nicoguaro.github.io/posts/numerical_challenge/numerical-29/#rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-22"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;    &lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mi"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;],&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a id="rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-23" name="rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-23" href="https://nicoguaro.github.io/posts/numerical_challenge/numerical-29/#rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-23"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;    &lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mf"&gt;4.25&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mf"&gt;2.75&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;],&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a id="rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-24" name="rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-24" href="https://nicoguaro.github.io/posts/numerical_challenge/numerical-29/#rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-24"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;    &lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mf"&gt;2.75&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mf"&gt;3.5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]],&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;dtype&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;float&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a id="rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-25" name="rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-25" href="https://nicoguaro.github.io/posts/numerical_challenge/numerical-29/#rest_code_cad9dd6c9222411c921eebb1fe93d81f-25"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;B&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;cholesky&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section id="julia"&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Julia&lt;/h3&gt;
